    "limitations": "Not full target profile or Phase3/4. Named headers require newline/semicolon after optional empty parentheses. Formula lists are parameter-only: later species promotion is a strict declaration_conflict rejection; const/var/$ qualifiers and nonempty ports deferred. No parameter declaration keyword. Unnamed reactions deferred. Canonical layout preserves source token/statement order, removes trivia, and does not normalize all equivalent models. Diagnostic classification is not universal: import \"secret.ant\" still reports syntax. No general unit algebra, automatic conversion, dimensional certification, compartment expressions or amount initialization. Eight separately selected original analytic models have numerical validation; this is not full-profile conformance. The original 90-case structural corpus retains numerical NOT_RUN stages. Expression literals retain 15 significant digits and zero-or-[1e-307,1e308] bounds; unit coefficient bounds unchanged. Group normalization follows pinned upstream behavior, not arbitrary algebra. Earlier evidence files/source receipt remain historical checkpoints; new arithmetic gate has no trajectory credit.",
